---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import schema from '../data/schema/ai-video-marketing.json';
---
<Layout
  title="AI Video for Marketing Teams — Scale Campaigns with VVP | Flipick"
  description="Flipick AI video for marketing teams: create studio-grade brand films, personalise at scale with Variable Video Production, and prove every view landed."
  keywords="AI video marketing, personalized video campaigns, AI marketing video, variable video production, multilingual marketing video, campaign video platform, enterprise video marketing"
  page="ai-video-marketing"
  schema={schema}
>
  <main>

<!-- ================= HERO ================= -->
<section class="hero camp-hero">
  <div class="wrap"><div class="hero-grid camp-hero-grid">
    <span class="eyebrow">AI Video &middot; Built for marketing teams</span>
    <h1 class="camp-title">Cinematic campaigns, <span class="serif-i">personalized to every customer.</span></h1>
    <p class="sub">Flipick lets marketing teams produce studio-grade video, tailor one master film into thousands of on-brand versions, and prove what each one drove &mdash; without a production house or agency timelines.</p>
    <div class="camp-cta-row"><a class="btn btn-primary" data-demo-link href="https://calendly.com/rahul-uppal-flipick/30min" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Book a demo</a> <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="/pricing">See pricing</a></div>
  </div></div>
</section>

<!-- ================= VIDEO SHOWREEL ================= -->
<section class="camp-flush"><div class="lwrap">
  <div class="vid rv" data-vid="mkt-showreel">
    <img class="vid-thumb" src="/assets/images/thumbnail/marketingPageHero.webp" alt="Play brand showreel" width="1280" height="720" loading="lazy">
    <span class="badge">SHOWREEL &middot; MADE ON FLIPICK</span>
    <div class="ov lower3"><b>Create &rarr; Personalize &rarr; Prove</b><span>AI VIDEO FOR MARKETING</span></div>
    <a href="#" class="play" aria-label="Play video" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"></a>
  </div>
</div></section>

<!-- ================= TRUST LOGOS ================= -->
<section class="section-pad-flush section-bordered">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="logostrip logostrip-lg rv">
      <div class="lbl">Trusted by marketing teams at</div>
      <div class="logorow">
        <div class="logoslot"><img src="/assets/images/customers/IIBF_logo.webp" alt="IIBF" width="1200" height="380" loading="lazy"></div>
        <div class="logoslot"><img src="/assets/images/customers/Pearson_logo.webp" alt="Pearson" width="1200" height="380" loading="lazy"></div>
        <div class="logoslot"><img src="/assets/images/customers/logo_elsevier.svg" alt="Elsevier" width="58" height="65" loading="lazy"></div>
        <div class="logoslot"><img src="/assets/images/customers/Clarivate_Logo.webp" alt="Clarivate" width="1200" height="380" loading="lazy"></div>
        <div class="logoslot"><img src="/assets/images/customers/PI-horizontal-logo.webp" alt="PI Industries" width="1200" height="380" loading="lazy"></div>
        <div class="logoslot"><img src="/assets/images/customers/jindal-steel.webp" alt="Jindal Steel" width="1200" height="380" loading="lazy"></div>
        <div class="logoslot"><img src="/assets/images/customers/logo_godrej.webp" alt="Godrej" width="1200" height="380" loading="lazy"></div>
        <div class="logoslot"><img src="/assets/images/customers/IFC-WBG.webp" alt="IFC World Bank Group" width="1200" height="380" loading="lazy"></div>
        <div class="logoslot"><img src="/assets/images/customers/logo_iica.webp" alt="IICA" width="1200" height="380" loading="lazy"></div>
      </div>
      <p class="trusted-cap">Trusted by marketing teams at IIBF, Pearson, Elsevier, Clarivate, PI Industries, Jindal Steel, Godrej, IFC World Bank Group, and IICA.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ================= WHAT IS PERSONALIZED VIDEO MARKETING ================= -->
<section class="camp-section-sm" aria-label="What is personalized video marketing">
  <div class="lwrap">
    <div class="fcard rv" style="border-left:4px solid var(--brand);padding:1.25rem 1.75rem;max-width:780px;margin:0 auto">
      <span class="eyebrow">What is personalized video marketing?</span>
      <p style="margin-top:.5rem"><strong>Personalized video marketing</strong> delivers a unique version of a promotional video to each recipient — with their name, segment, city, language or account-specific offer embedded in the content itself. Unlike email personalization (text in a subject line), personalized video creates a viewing experience that feels individually produced. Flipick&rsquo;s Variable Video Production (VVP) generates up to thousands of personalized versions from a single master film — each rendered, not edited in post — and delivers them via authenticated links with full engagement tracking.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ================= THE PROBLEM ================= -->
<section class="camp-section"><div class="lwrap">
  <div class="sec-head rv camp-sh"><span class="eyebrow">The problem</span>
    <h2>Creative can&rsquo;t keep up with your calendar.</h2></div>
  <div class="grid3"><div class="fcard camp-fcard rv"><h3>Creative is a bottleneck</h3><p>Every asset means a brief, an agency, a shoot and weeks of back-and-forth &mdash; long after the campaign window has moved on.</p></div><div class="fcard camp-fcard rv"><h3>One size fits no one</h3><p>A single generic film goes to every segment, region and offer, because personalising it by hand simply doesn&rsquo;t scale.</p></div><div class="fcard camp-fcard rv"><h3>No proof it worked</h3><p>&ldquo;It got views&rdquo; isn&rsquo;t a result. Marketing is left guessing which video actually moved the funnel.</p></div></div>
</div></section>

<!-- ================= WHAT YOU CAN SHIP ================= -->
<section class="camp-section"><div class="lwrap">
  <div class="sec-head rv camp-sh"><span class="eyebrow">What you can ship</span>
    <h2>Every kind of campaign video &mdash; at scale.</h2></div>

  <div class="grid2 rv camp-uc rev">
    <div class="vid small rv" data-vid="mkt-personalized">
      <img class="vid-thumb" src="/assets/images/thumbnail/by-industry.webp" alt="Play personalized campaign video" width="1920" height="1080" loading="lazy">
      <span class="badge">SAMPLE &middot; PERSONALIZED CAMPAIGN</span>
      <div class="ov lower3"><b>One film, every customer</b><span>VARIABLE VIDEO PRODUCTION</span></div>
      <a href="#" class="play" aria-label="Play video" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"></a>
    </div>
    <div><span class="eyebrow">Personalize at scale &middot; VVP</span>
      <h3>One film. Every customer their own.</h3>
      <p>Variable Video Production turns a single master into thousands of versions &mdash; by name, segment, city, language or offer &mdash; each rendered, not bolted on. Deliver by email, link, WhatsApp or your site.</p>
      <a class="btn btn-ghost" data-demo-link href="https://calendly.com/rahul-uppal-flipick/30min" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">See it on your brand</a></div>
  </div>

  <div class="grid2 rv camp-uc">
    <div class="vid small rv" data-vid="mkt-multilingual">
      <img class="vid-thumb" src="/assets/images/thumbnail/by-content.webp" alt="Play multilingual marketing video" width="1920" height="1080" loading="lazy">
      <span class="badge">SAMPLE &middot; ONE VIDEO, FIVE LANGUAGES</span>
      <div class="ov lower3"><b>Same brand, every language</b><span>MULTILINGUAL MARKETING</span></div>
      <a href="#" class="play" aria-label="Play video" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"></a>
    </div>
    <div><span class="eyebrow">Localize for every market</span>
      <h3>Speak to each market in its own language.</h3>
      <p>Produce once and ship in every language your customers speak &mdash; same brand, same look, localized voice and on-screen text. No re-shoots, no separate agencies per region.</p>
      <a class="btn btn-ghost" data-demo-link href="https://calendly.com/rahul-uppal-flipick/30min" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Talk to us</a></div>
  </div>

  <div class="grid2 rv camp-uc rev">
    <div class="vid small rv" data-vid="mkt-promo">
      <img class="vid-thumb" src="/assets/images/thumbnail/festive-product-promo.webp" alt="Play festive product promo video" width="1920" height="1080" loading="lazy">
      <span class="badge">SAMPLE &middot; FESTIVE PRODUCT PROMO</span>
      <div class="ov lower3"><b>Launch films, on the day</b><span>PROMOS &amp; LAUNCHES</span></div>
      <a href="#" class="play" aria-label="Play video" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"></a>
    </div>
    <div><span class="eyebrow">Launches, promos &amp; festive</span>
      <h3>Launch films and offers, on the day.</h3>
      <p>Spin up cinematic launch and festive promos &mdash; then re-skin them per region, retailer or offer, with prices and CTAs on overlays that never touch the base video.</p>
      <a class="btn btn-ghost" data-demo-link href="https://calendly.com/rahul-uppal-flipick/30min" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Book a demo</a></div>
  </div>
</div></section>

<!-- ================= HOW IT WORKS ================= -->
<section class="camp-section"><div class="lwrap">
  <div class="sec-head rv camp-sh-sm"><span class="eyebrow">How it works for marketing</span>
    <h2>Create &rarr; Distribute &rarr; Prove.</h2></div>
  <div class="grid3">
    <div class="fcard camp-fcard rv"><h3>Create</h3><p>A brief becomes a screenplay and storyboard you approve, on brand, before a credit is spent.</p></div>
    <div class="fcard camp-fcard rv"><h3>Distribute</h3><p>Personalize into thousands of versions and deliver by email, link, WhatsApp or site.</p></div>
    <div class="fcard camp-fcard camp-fcard-teal rv"><h3>Prove</h3><p>Authenticated views, completion and CTA tracking tie every version to what it drove.</p></div>
  </div>
</div></section>

<!-- ================= PROOF FOR MARKETERS ================= -->
<section class="camp-section-sm"><div class="lwrap"><div class="darkband rv camp-db">
  <span class="eyebrow">Proof for marketers</span>
  <h2>Report on outcomes, not impressions.</h2>
  <div class="grid3">
    <div><div class="camp-stat-val">100%</div><div class="camp-stat-lbl">views tied to a known recipient</div></div>
    <div><div class="camp-stat-val">1&rarr;many</div><div class="camp-stat-lbl">personalized versions from one master</div></div>
    <div><div class="camp-stat-val camp-stat-alt">CTA</div><div class="camp-stat-lbl">click-through tracked per version</div></div>
  </div>
  <p class="camp-note">Figures shown are illustrative.</p>
</div></div></section>

<!-- ================= WHY MARKETING TEAMS CHOOSE FLIPICK ================= -->
<section class="camp-section"><div class="lwrap">
  <div class="sec-head rv camp-sh-sm"><span class="eyebrow">Why marketing teams choose Flipick</span>
    <h2>Not another clip generator.</h2></div>
  <div class="mcheck"><div class="it"><h4>On-brand, every frame</h4><p>Your presenters, products and identity stay exact across every scene and every version.</p></div><div class="it"><h4>Personalise without re-shooting</h4><p>One master film becomes thousands of variants by name, segment, region or offer.</p></div><div class="it"><h4>Days, not weeks</h4><p>Go from brief to a finished, approved film inside a campaign cycle &mdash; no production house.</p></div><div class="it"><h4>Proof to the CTA</h4><p>Authenticated views, completion and click-through tie each video to what it drove.</p></div><div class="it"><h4>Every language</h4><p>Localise one production into every market you sell in, without recording again.</p></div><div class="it"><h4>Simple credit pricing</h4><p class="geo-cloak" data-inr="1 credit = ₹1. Pay for what you make and send — no seats, no retainers." data-usd="1 credit = $0.01 (1¢). Pay for what you make and send — no seats, no retainers.">1 credit = &#8377;1. Pay for what you make and send &mdash; no seats, no retainers.</p></div></div>
</div></section>

<!-- ================= PRICING ================= -->
<section class="camp-section-sm"><div class="lwrap"><div class="fcard rv camp-callout camp-callout-brand">
  <span class="eyebrow">Pricing</span>
  <h3 class="geo-cloak" data-inr="Simple credit pricing. 1 credit = ₹1." data-usd="Simple credit pricing. 1 credit = $0.01 (1¢).">Simple credit pricing. 1 credit = &#8377;1.</h3>
  <p>Pay for the video you make and the people you send it to &mdash; no seats, no retainers. Estimate any campaign in seconds.</p>
  <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/pricing">See pricing &amp; calculator &#8594;</a>
</div></div></section>

<!-- ================= FAQ ================= -->
<section id="faq" aria-label="Frequently asked questions">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head rv sec-head--center sec-head--mb-md">
      <span class="eyebrow">FAQ</span>
      <h2>Common questions about <span class="serif-i text-brand">AI video for marketing.</span></h2>
    </div>
    <div class="faq rv">
      <details open>
        <summary>How does Flipick let a marketing team create campaign videos without an agency?</summary>
        <p>Flipick turns a creative brief into a screenplay and storyboard you approve before a credit is spent. The finished, on-brand cinematic film is typically delivered inside a campaign cycle &mdash; no shoots, no back-and-forth with an agency, and no weeks of edit rounds.</p>
      </details>
      <details>
        <summary>What is Variable Video Production and how does it personalize a campaign video?</summary>
        <p>Variable Video Production (VVP) takes a single master film and renders it into thousands of versions &mdash; by customer name, segment, city, language or offer. Each version is rendered from the film itself, not by overlaying text, so every field is part of the video.</p>
      </details>
      <details>
        <summary>Can Flipick deliver localized video ads for different markets without re-shooting?</summary>
        <p>Yes. Flipick localizes one master production into every language and market you sell in &mdash; same brand, same look, with localized voice and on-screen text. No re-shoots and no separate agency engagements per region.</p>
      </details>
      <details>
        <summary>How does Flipick prove that a video actually moved the marketing funnel?</summary>
        <p>Every view is tied to a known recipient. Flipick tracks completion and CTA click-through per version, so marketing teams can report on outcomes, not just impressions, and know exactly which video version drove which result.</p>
      </details>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ================= CLOSING CTA ================= -->
<section class="closing" aria-label="Call to action">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2>Put your next campaign <span class="serif-i">on Flipick.</span></h2>
    <p>Book a demo and we&rsquo;ll take one of your briefs from screenplay to a personalized, measurable campaign.</p>
    <div class="ctas-center">
      <a class="btn btn-ghost" data-demo-link href="https://calendly.com/rahul-uppal-flipick/30min" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Book a demo</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

</main>

  <script is:inline slot="scripts" src="/assets/js/video-player.js"></script>
  <script is:inline slot="scripts">
   const _rv = document.querySelectorAll('.rv');
if ('IntersectionObserver' in window) {
  const io = new IntersectionObserver(es => es.forEach(e => { if (e.isIntersecting) { e.target.classList.add('in'); io.unobserve(e.target); } }), { threshold: 0, rootMargin: '0px 0px -8% 0px' });
  _rv.forEach(el => io.observe(el));
  setTimeout(() => _rv.forEach(el => el.classList.add('in')), 3000);
}
  </script>
</Layout>